{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "08ac0937-51c2-89cb-b8ee-531e418a0407",
  "created_at": "2026-02-03T10:51:42-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Hector Pagan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:48:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra. Good morning, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:48:32-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, honey. Yes, so, my neighbor told me last week you need to register a yard sale now, and I said, nobody registers a yard sale, Hector, you just put the table out. And she said no, you call the city. So here I am, calling the city."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:48:51-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, your neighbor's not wrong. Depending on the sale, there's usually a registration. Is this at your home?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:48:59-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, ma'am, one fifty-seven Marsh Street, down the Point. I rent the upstairs, but the landlord said it's fine, the porch and the little driveway. It's just some old stuff, a couple of lamps, a bike nobody rides. And now I have to fill out paperwork for a bike."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:49:18-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I know, I know. It's mostly so the city knows what's happening on the street, parking and signs and all that. Do you have a date in mind?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:49:29-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Probably a Saturday, whenever it's not freezing. Which, in February, you tell me when that is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:49:36-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Fair enough. Most people wait until spring, honestly. You can register ahead of time though."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:49:43-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so what's the fee? Because if it's wicked expensive I'm just giving the bike to my cousin and calling it a day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:49:53-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me pull that up so I give you the right number. Bear with me one second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:50:00-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time, dear. I'm just sitting in the truck, I'm not going anywhere. Hang on, I'm going under the bridge, so if I [inaudible] sound like I'm underwater, that's [line breaks up] why."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:50:14-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hector? You cut out on me there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:50:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, sorry, I'm back. Bridge ate me. What did you say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:50:23-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I was just checking the fee. It's a small registration fee for the sale, and it's good for the one date you list. I don't have the exact amount on my screen, so I'll have the permit desk confirm it. Can I take your number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:50:41-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A small fee, okay. That's all I needed to hear, kind of. Yeah, it's four zero one, five five five, zero one eight zero."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:50:51-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four zero one, five five five, zero one eight zero. Got it. And you said one fifty-seven Marsh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:50:59-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Marsh Street. Upstairs unit, but it's the same address."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:51:04-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Someone will call you back today or tomorrow with the amount and how to fill out the form. You can also stop in and pick one up at City Hall."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:51:16-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll wait for the call. Honestly, it's a lot of fuss for a bike, but fine. If it's more than a few bucks, though, the bike goes to my cousin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:51:28-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Well, I hope you get a nice sunny Saturday out of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:51:34-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "From your mouth to God's ears. Thank you, Sandra. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:51:39-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Hector. Bye now."
    }
  ],
